@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title EasyBackup 本地数据目录与 BlobStore 对象布局

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam FolderBorderColor #16A34A
skinparam FolderBackgroundColor #F0FDF4
skinparam FileBorderColor #64748B
skinparam FileBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ArtifactBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArtifactBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F59E0B
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB

folder "EASYBACKUP_DATA_DIR" as DataDir #FAF5FF {
  file "easybackup.db\n+ WAL / SHM" as Database
  folder "locks/" as Locks {
    file "{task_id}.lock" as LocalLock
  }
  folder "logs/" as Logs
  folder "secrets/" as Secrets
  folder "delta-cache/" as Cache {
    file "{task_hash}/{chain_hash}/\n{version_hash}.base" as BaseCache
  }
}

folder "BlobStore 根\nLocalStorage.path\n或 s3://bucket/{prefix}" as StoreRoot #F0FDF4 {
  folder "v1/tasks/{task_id}" as TaskPrefix {
    file "write.lock.json" as Lease
    folder "chains/{chain_id}/snapshots/{snapshot_id}" as SnapshotPrefix {
      folder "volumes/" as Volumes {
        artifact "{snapshot_id}-volume-{NNNNN}\n.tar.zst | .tar.gz | .tar" as Volume
      }
      folder "patches/" as Patches {
        artifact "{snapshot_id}-delta-{NNNNN}\n.vcdiff.zst" as Patch
      }
      file "manifest.json" as Manifest
      file "commit.json" as Commit
    }
  }
}

Database ..> Manifest : snapshots.manifest_key
Database ..> Volume : full file_version.object_key
Database ..> Patch : delta file_version.object_key
Manifest --> Volume : 文件 → 完整分卷
Manifest --> Patch : 文件 → Patch
Manifest ..> Volume : delta.base → 完整 Base 分卷
Commit --> Manifest : manifest_sha256
Lease ..> SnapshotPrefix : 保护任务级写入
BaseCache ..> Volume : 缓存可由远端 Base 重建

note bottom of Volume
  普通文件按目标大小分卷。
  大文件完整 Base 或差分失败回退会独占一个 tar 分卷，
  便于未来只读取该文件的 Base。
end note

note bottom of Patch
  Patch 是 zstd 压缩的 VCDIFF 对象，不是 tar。
  Manifest 同时携带该 Patch 及其完整 Base 的自包含定位。
end note

note bottom of Commit
  远端发布顺序：
  volumes / patches
  → manifest.json
  → 再次确认租约
  → commit.json（可见性边界）
  → SQLite 事务提交
end note

note bottom of BaseCache
  delta-cache 是可删除、可重建的明文性能层，
  不是恢复所需的唯一副本。
end note

@enduml
